WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:05.200
I was already in the works trying to develop this app for two years.

00:08.080 --> 00:11.840
They took over and within three weeks my app was launched.

00:16.080 --> 00:21.280
I've worked with several providers in the past and the result has been terrible.

00:21.280 --> 00:27.040
This is the first time that I've worked with two people that go above and beyond for you.

00:27.040 --> 00:39.920
And Omer has simplified everything, created great handover notes for me and got the whole thing ticking along really well. The whole project with Zia was amazing.

00:39.920 --> 00:44.000
The outcome that was promised was delivered.

00:45.760 --> 00:50.160
So his after sales support continues to this day.

00:50.160 --> 00:52.640
I will be definitely working with him again in the future.

00:53.600 --> 00:55.760
Omer and Zia are who you have to work with.

00:57.040 --> 01:01.040
I highly recommend Zia and his team at Zumetrix.
